<title>JAPAN: TABLE-JAPAN JULY DOMESTIC WPI UP 2.0 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>TABLE-JAPAN JULY DOMESTIC WPI UP 2.0 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's domestic wholesale price index (WPI), a key component of overall WPI, rose 2.0 percent in July from a year earlier, the Bank of Japan said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The following is a detailed breakdown of the July WPI:</p>
<p>Year-on-year (in percent)</p>
<p>	     July	   June</p>
<p> Overall  +1.8	   +1.9</p>
<p> Domestic +2.0	   +2.0</p>
<p> Exports  -0.8	   -0.9</p>
<p> Imports  +4.2	   +5.9</p>
<p>Month-on-month (in percent, index base year 1990):</p>
<p>	     July	  June  Index</p>
<p> Overall  +0.1	  -0.7   94.5</p>
<p> Domestic +0.2	  -0.1   97.2</p>
<p> Exports  +0.2	  -3.2   84.7</p>
<p> Imports  -1.5	  -3.2   82.7</p>
</text>
